[ti:Asirem]
[ar:Lounès Matoub; Malika YAMI]
[al:Tiɣṛi n Yemma]
[length:4:17]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:17.48] Ay afrux ɛjel ferfer
[00:19.81] Selmiyi ɣef igawawen
[00:22.62] Ur zgal ḥedd s uɣafer
[00:25.06] JSK d wid tt-iḥemmlen
[00:27.83] Ul-iw iccedha aken-iẓer
[00:30.36] Ha-t-a yetqelleq lxaṭeṛ
[00:32.85] Nenfa ad d-nuɣal d iɣriben
[00:35.71] Yiwen wass talwit ad teḍher
[00:37.93] Tafsut ɛzizen ad as-neḥḍeṛ
[00:40.64] Ad tent-id-necnu gar-awen
[00:43.57]
[00:58.73] Di tsedawit ad d-nemlil
[01:01.22] Tmanyin at-id-nemmekti
[01:03.92] Ad d-tewwet Lǧuher amendil
[01:06.41] Mi d-tedda Tmaziɣt-nni
[01:09.08] Abrid n liser ur yergil
[01:11.67] Di lǧil uzekka ad nektil
[01:14.33] Ayen s way-s ara yefṛeḥ lebɣi
[01:17.01] Wid as-iqqaren ur tettbeddil
[01:19.39] Tfeggeḍ izad-as lkil
[01:22.01] Asen-nessexreb lewhi
[01:24.86]
[01:40.10] Ulac assif d-iḥemlen
[01:42.50] Ur nris ara yiwen wass
[01:45.22] Xas ad-ɣlin yergazen
[01:47.67] Ur gellunt ara tissas
[01:50.43] Ad nqabel ussan berriken
[01:52.88] Ad d-yawed lweqt ad fakken
[01:55.59] Ad aɣ-yeḍleq lweswas
[01:58.13] Ad yens ujajih yekren
[02:00.62] Ad nefḍen wid tt-ixerzen
[02:03.45] Ɣurwat wi igezzmen layas
[02:06.14]
